  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Whether it is palms, tea leaves, crystal balls, entrails, dissection of owl pellets, the examination of the flight formation of a flock of birds, the examination of birth defects, astrology, or tarot, you have done it.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Tell fortune class feature, Cha 15</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use the tell fortune class feature two additional times per day.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can take this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancy-feats#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
